      },
      "english": "So you can't really represent very big numbers, and you can't represent very small numbers.",
      "chinese": "所以，你无法真正表示很大的数，也无法表示很小的数。",
      "checked_meaning": "Both inability statements, for large and small numbers, remain negative."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "segment-84",
      "location": {
        "video": {
          "media_id": "361e204a-50c7-40cd-9054-072b01a27659",
          "media_revision": "1"
        },
        "start_ms": 561680,
        "end_ms": 571100
      },
      "english": "And the reason is that this exponent is, you know, it's only, you know, five bits of, of exponent from, compared to eight.",
      "chinese": "原因就在于，这里的指数只有五位，而不是八位。",
      "checked_meaning": "Exponent width compares five bits against eight."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "segment-85",
      "location": {
        "video": {
          "media_id": "361e204a-50c7-40cd-9054-072b01a27659",
          "media_revision": "1"
        },
        "start_ms": 572170,
        "end_ms": 582270
      },
      "english": "So, if you train with FP16, which people did back, back in the, you know, day, you will get instability.",
      "chinese": "所以，如果用 FP16 训练，就像以前人们做的那样，就会出现不稳定的情况。",
      "checked_meaning": "FP16 training is conditional and unstable."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "segment-86",
      "location": {
        "video": {
          "media_id": "361e204a-50c7-40cd-9054-072b01a27659",
          "media_revision": "1"
        },
        "start_ms": 582890,
        "end_ms": 588690
      },
      "english": "You'll get underflow, you'll get overflow, you'll get NANs, it's pretty challenging.",
      "chinese": "会出现下溢、上溢，还会出现 NAN，处理起来相当棘手。",
      "checked_meaning": "Underflow, overflow and NaN all remain present."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "segment-87",
      "location": {
        "video": {
          "media_id": "361e204a-50c7-40cd-9054-072b01a27659",
          "media_revision": "1"
        },
        "start_ms": 590660,
        "end_ms": 595080
      },
      "english": "So then, so beef float 16 was invented.",
      "chinese": "于是，beef float 16（beef float 16，转写存疑）被发明出来了。",
      "checked_meaning": "Uncertain machine term is retained rather than rewriting English."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "segment-90",
      "location": {
        "video": {
          "media_id": "361e204a-50c7-40cd-9054-072b01a27659",
          "media_revision": "1"
        },
        "start_ms": 606780,
        "end_ms": 613740
      },
      "english": "It's the number of bits that's going to be the same as Fp16, but we're going to shift some of the bits from the mantissa to the exponent.",
      "chinese": "总位数仍然与 Fp16 相同，但我们要把尾数中的一些位移给指数。",
      "checked_meaning": "Total bits stay the same; bits move from mantissa to exponent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "segment-92",
      "location": {
        "video": {
          "media_id": "361e204a-50c7-40cd-9054-072b01a27659",
          "media_revision": "1"
        },
        "start_ms": 623110,
        "end_ms": 625750
      },
      "english": "And it actually has the same dynamic range as float 32.",
      "chinese": "而且，它实际上具有与 float 32 相同的动态范围。",
      "checked_meaning": "The dynamic range is the same as float32."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "segment-93",
      "location": {
        "video": {
          "media_id": "361e204a-50c7-40cd-9054-072b01a27659",
          "media_revision": "1"
        },
        "start_ms": 626460,
        "end_ms": 631600
      },
      "english": "But, of course, the, the resolution is worse because there's no free lunch here.",
      "chinese": "但当然，它的分辨率会更差，因为这里没有免费的午餐。",
      "checked_meaning": "The resolution tradeoff remains worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "segment-189",
      "location": {
        "video": {
          "media_id": "361e204a-50c7-40cd-9054-072b01a27659",
