        },
        "start_ms": 1194780,
        "end_ms": 1209680
      },
      "english": "And I'm going to produce a tensor, or a Heria matrix, where the dimensions are indexed by C1 and C2 and anything that is not mentioned here, the hidden, gets summed out.",
      "chinese": "我要生成一个张量，或者一个 Heria 矩阵（Heria，转写存疑），维度由 C1 和 C2 索引。这里没有提到的维度，也就是 hidden，都会被求和消去。",
      "checked_meaning": "Unmentioned hidden dimension is summed out, with original code identifiers."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "segment-191",
      "location": {
        "video": {
          "media_id": "361e204a-50c7-40cd-9054-072b01a27659",
          "media_revision": "1"
        },
        "start_ms": 1210820,
        "end_ms": 1223840
      },
      "english": "So the way this works is I'm going to sum over, enumerate over all possible values of all the variables that occur here, which are sequence, hidden, and C2.",
      "chinese": "它的工作方式是：我会遍历这里出现的所有变量的所有可能取值并求和，这些变量是 sequence、hidden 和 C2。",
